    {"problem": "The lower floor feels damp all summer", "solution": "River humidity finds its way into older foundations. A properly sized heat pump pulls moisture out as it cools, and an HRV or ERV keeps fresh air moving. We size it to dry the air as well as cool it."},
    {"problem": "A neighbour swears heat pumps quit in a Brockville winter", "solution": "Older heat pumps did struggle in the cold. Cold-climate models rated to -30°C are a different machine, and we size them to your home's heat loss with backup heat planned for the rare nights colder than that."},
